target: internal/push/push.go
verify: go test ./internal/push/ -count=1 -run 'TestDecide$'
expect: run recorded asks-open — broken
why:    issue #41: runs that ended on open asks had no outcome but `blocked`, which this list reads as a broken tree, so the push was refused and the tip was never stamped as a review baseline. The next run then re-reviewed the whole branch. asks-open means unfinished, not broken.
--- old
var BrokenOutcomes = []string{"test-failure", "blocked", "abandoned"}
--- new
var BrokenOutcomes = []string{"test-failure", "blocked", "abandoned", "asks-open"}
